<title>SWEDEN: Stena Line slumps into losses in 9-mo.</title>
<headline>Stena Line slumps into losses in 9-mo.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish ferry company Stena Line reports for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Result after fin items	  LOSS   251  vs    272  PROFIT</p>
<p> Sales					7,070  vs  7,566</p>
<p> Operating costs			  6,549  vs  6,553</p>
